# docs.vulkan.org / isocpp.org above; both are live major project sites for a
# real browser). Cited for the libpfm4 source browser
# (research/cpu-pmu/event-naming.md) and the Asymptote docs
# (research/manim/asymptote.md), among other research surveys.
^https?://([^/]+\.)?sourceforge\.net/
^https?://([^/]+\.)?sourceforge\.io/
